1
00:12:42,857 --> 00:12:48,857
The Larva Island Movie is a animation, family film directed by Ahn Byoung-wook.

2
00:25:25,714 --> 00:25:31,714
Back at home, Chuck relates the island shenanigans of his larva pals Red and Yellow
to a skeptical reporter in this movie sequel to the hit cartoon.

3
00:38:08,571 --> 00:38:14,571
Larva is a South Korean 3D computer-animated television
series produced by TUBA Entertainment in Seoul.

4
00:50:51,428 --> 00:50:57,428
Its main characters are two larvae that never speak,
although they do make expressive sounds.

5
01:03:34,285 --> 01:03:40,285
The cartoon exists in their small world where miniature adventures occur.

6
01:16:17,142 --> 01:16:23,142
The film explores themes of island, lava, wild animal, larvae.
